  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n\ud83d\udcde **HR Support Center Phone Number:**\n**1-800-380-4681**\n\n\ud83d\udce7 **HR Support Center Email:**\n**HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**\n\n\ud83d\udcde **Corporate HR Phone Number:**\n**540-362-4911** \u2014 This is the primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n---\n\n**Tips for Calling:**\n- When contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays.\n- For optimal service and shorter wait times, it is recommended to call at around **11:30 AM**, as this time tends to have less call volume.\n- Calling the HR number can connect you with a representative who can help with matters such as **job applications, employee benefits, interview scheduling, and workplace policies.**",
